{"text": "Pell Bookkeeping Services\n1407 Front Street, Unit B, Traverse City, Michigan 49686 · 231-555-0118\n\nMEMO — PRIVATE. Please do not leave this on the front desk.\n\nTo: Dr. Annika Ruud, owner, Quillfeather Animal Hospital, P.C.\n\nFrom: Winston Pell\n\nDate: November 5, 2025\n\nRe: October 2025 reconciliation, operating account at Mackinaw Straits Bank\nending 4471 (full no. 0218 5530 4471)\n\n1. Summary\n Balance per bank statement at 10/31/2025: $48,216.09\n Add deposits in transit (card batches of 10/30 and 10/31): $3,904.55\n Less outstanding checks: ($6,118.40)\n Adjusted bank balance: $46,002.24\n Balance per QuickBooks Online: $50,327.24\n Unreconciled difference: $4,325.00\n\n2. What the difference is\nThe difference is two checks that cleared the bank but were never entered in the\nbooks. I pulled the images.\n\n Check no. 5518, dated Oct. 3, $2,350.00, payable to Kayleigh Dombek, memo\nline \"reimb. supplies\".\n Check no. 5524, dated Oct. 17, $1,975.00, payable to K. Dombek, memo line\nblank.\n\nBoth carry your signature stamp, not a pen signature. There are no receipts in the\nsupplies folder that come close to either amount. As you know, Kayleigh is the\nonly person besides you with access to the stamp and the check stock.\n\nI also went back through the year. Checks 5391 ($1,200, June 6) and 5447 ($1,640,\nAug. 22) follow the same pattern and were coded to \"Medical supplies — Vetline\"\nalthough Vetline Supply Co. has no matching invoices. Total of the four: $7,165.00.\n\n3. Other items\n ACH debit of $1,200.00 on the 15th of each month to Tamarind Wellness LLC. I\nunderstand from our call that this is your own therapy practice bill and should\nbe coded to owner draw, not to the clinic. I have reclassified ten months.\n Outstanding more than 90 days: check 5302 to Jolene Marrs (former kennel\nassistant), final pay of $412.18. Her last address on file is 609 Wadsworth St,\nTraverse City. Michigan unclaimed property rules will apply next year.\n Merchant deposits tie to the processor reports. Company debit card ending\n9958 is in your name only.\n\n4. What I suggest\nPlease do not confront Ms. Dombek yet. Lock the signature stamp away today, ask\nthe bank about Positive Pay, and call me on my cell, 231.555.0164, before Friday. If\nyou want to involve the police or your insurer I can prepare a schedule with\ncheck images. She has worked for you for nine years and I know her husband is\nill, so I am keeping this between the two of us and writing to your personal\naddress, annika.ruud@northportmail.example, not the clinic inbox.\n\nW.P.", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 430 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Annika Ruud", "Winston Pell", "Kayleigh Dombek", "Jolene Marrs", "Ms. Dombek", "W.P.", "annika.ruud"], "companies": ["Pell Bookkeeping Services", "Quillfeather Animal Hospital, P.C.", "Mackinaw Straits Bank", "QuickBooks Online", "Tamarind Wellness LLC", "Vetline Supply Co."]}, "topics": {"places": ["Traverse City", "Michigan"], "health": ["ill"], "sensitive": ["annika"], "names": ["Annika", "Kayleigh", "Jolene", "W.P."]}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 121.5, "modelMs": 23703.19999999553, "topicMs": 21022, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "Pell Bookkeeping Services", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Pell Bookkeeping Services"}, {"start": 26, "end": 51, "text": "1407 Front Street, Unit B", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "1407 Front Street, Unit B"}, {"start": 53, "end": 66, "text": "Traverse City", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Traverse City"}, {"start": 68, "end": 76, "tex